        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F006",
          "span_text": "星期一，在东努沙登加拉省东弗洛勒斯县克拉坦洛村，勒沃托比拉基拉基火山夜间喷发后可以看到一座倒塌的建筑。（Arnold Wellianto/法新社/Getty Images）\n\n",
          "start_offset": 554,
          "end_offset": 642,
          "sentence_ids": [
            13,
            14
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "non_factual_boilerplate"
          ],
          "importance": "not_applicable",
          "evidence_status": "non_factual_source_text",
          "structured_attributes": [],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F007",
          "span_text": "社交媒体上流传的照片和视频显示，数吨火山碎屑覆盖霍肯等村庄房屋直至屋顶，炽热的火山物质还使房屋起火。\n\n该机构表示，乌兰吉唐地区附近的六个村庄普卢莱拉、纳沃科特、霍肯贾亚、克拉坦洛、博鲁和博鲁克当至少有10,000人受到喷发影响。\n\n在伊勒布拉地区，四个村庄受到影响，即杜利帕利村、诺博、努拉贝伦及里昂里塔；在蒂特赫纳地区，同样影响四个村庄，即孔加村、科巴索马、博康沃洛马唐和瓦托瓦拉。\n\n",
          "start_offset": 642,
          "end_offset": 837,
          "sentence_ids": [
            15,
            16,
            17
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "damage",
            "affected_population",
            "location"
          ],
          "importance": "critical",
          "evidence_status": "attributed_claim",
          "structured_attributes": [
            {
              "attribute": "wulanggitang_affected",
              "value": {
                "value": 10000,
                "qualifier": "at_least"
              },
              "unit": "people"
            }
          ],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F008",
          "span_text": "星期一，东弗洛勒斯县克拉坦洛村，勒沃托比拉基拉基火山夜间喷发后涌出浓烟。（Arnold Wellianto/法新社/Getty Images）\n\n",
          "start_offset": 837,
          "end_offset": 910,
          "sentence_ids": [
            18,
            19
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "non_factual_boilerplate"
          ],
          "importance": "not_applicable",
          "evidence_status": "non_factual_source_text",
          "structured_attributes": [],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F009",
          "span_text": "勒沃托比拉基拉基是东努沙登加拉省东弗洛勒斯地区一对层状火山之一，当地称它们为丈夫山和妻子山，“Laki laki”意为男人。与之成对的是勒沃托比佩伦普安火山，即女人山。\n\n1月，在勒沃托比拉基拉基火山开始喷发、喷出浓密云团并迫使政府关闭岛上的弗朗斯塞达机场后，约6,500人撤离。未报告伤亡或重大损坏，但由于地震活动，该机场自那时起一直关闭。\n\n",
          "start_offset": 910,
          "end_offset": 1083,
          "sentence_ids": [
            20,
            21,
            22,
            23
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "location",
            "disaster_occurrence",
            "evacuation",
            "infrastructure"
          ],
          "importance": "supplementary",
          "evidence_status": "explicitly_reported",
          "structured_attributes": [
            {
              "attribute": "scope",
              "value": "火山地理背景及历史上的1月喷发事件",
              "unit": null
            },
            {
              "attribute": "january_evacuated",
              "value": {
                "value": 6500,
                "qualifier": "about"
              },
              "unit": "people"
            }
          ],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F010",
          "span_text": "印度尼西亚火山喷发：为何这座火山会产生闪电 | About That\n\n",
          "start_offset": 1083,
          "end_offset": 1119,
          "sentence_ids": [
            24
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "non_factual_boilerplate"
          ],
          "importance": "not_applicable",
          "evidence_status": "non_factual_source_text",
          "structured_attributes": [],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F011",
          "span_text": "能源和矿产资源部地质部门负责人穆罕默德·瓦菲德星期一在视频会议上表示，由于火山口内岩浆堵塞，1月喷发与星期一喷发性质不同。这种堵塞使可探测的地震活动减少，同时积聚压力。\n\n瓦菲德表示：“自星期五以来的喷发是由于隐藏能量的积累。”\n\n",
          "start_offset": 1119,
          "end_offset": 1235,
          "sentence_ids": [
            25,
            26
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "disaster_occurrence",
            "cause"
          ],
          "importance": "important",
          "evidence_status": "attributed_claim",
          "structured_attributes": [
            {
              "attribute": "attribution",
              "value": "穆罕默德·瓦菲德",
              "unit": null
            }
          ],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F012",
          "span_text": "这是印度尼西亚短短数周内第二次火山喷发。西苏门答腊省的马拉皮火山是该国最活跃火山之一，于10月27日喷发，至少三次喷出浓密火山灰柱，火山碎屑覆盖附近村庄，但没有伤亡报告。\n\n马拉皮火山去年晚些时候的一次喷发造成20多人死亡。\n\n",
          "start_offset": 1235,
          "end_offset": 1349,
          "sentence_ids": [
            27,
            28,
            29
          ],
          "fact_types": [
            "disaster_occurrence",
            "casualties"
          ],
          "importance": "supplementary",
          "evidence_status": "explicitly_reported",
          "structured_attributes": [
            {
              "attribute": "scope",
              "value": "另一次马拉皮火山喷发",
              "unit": null
            }
          ],
          "annotation_note": null
        },
        {
          "fact_span_id": "A002_F013",
          "span_text": "为您的早晨和夜晚增添一点“美好”。\n\n环境正在变化，这份每周通讯将为您介绍我们对此所做的工作。",
          "start_offset": 1349,
          "end_offset": 1396,
